  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may spend a spell point as an immediate action to dismiss any magic effect which you could normally dismiss as a standard action.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you have the Card Casting drawback, this feat counts as both a Deck feat and a Drawback feat. Additionally, when you dismiss an effect you may return any cards used to create the dismissed effect to your hand (even if you do so as a standard action).</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Expanded Spheres: Cardcaster’s Gamble</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
